<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bangor Hydro said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bangor Hydro said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Bangor Hydro-Electric Co to underperform from neutral, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/4 to 7-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
